# Line endings matter here: bash scripts run inside WSL and break with CRLF.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Screenshots: never let the eol rules near them.
*.png binary

# Dev notes live in the repo (and in clones), but must not reach end users: the
# ZIP root is a product decision - one thing to click. GitHub builds its
# "Download ZIP" with git archive, which honours export-ignore.
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
